@RateLimitApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5295
@merchant = merchant-a
@payoutId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Submit a payout. Copy payoutId from the 202 response above into @payoutId.
POST {{RateLimitApi_HostAddress}}/payouts
X-Demo-Merchant-Id: {{merchant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountInCents": 2599,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Check payout status as its owner. Repeat quickly to exercise the polling limit.
GET {{RateLimitApi_HostAddress}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}
X-Demo-Merchant-Id: {{merchant}}
Accept: application/json

### Submit with another merchant. This uses a separate token bucket.
POST {{RateLimitApi_HostAddress}}/payouts
X-Demo-Merchant-Id: merchant-b
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountInCents": 1500,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Export reconciliation CSV. Send simultaneous requests to exercise the two shared slots.
GET {{RateLimitApi_HostAddress}}/reconciliation/export
X-Demo-Merchant-Id: {{merchant}}
Accept: text/csv

### A missing merchant header returns 400.
GET {{RateLimitApi_HostAddress}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development).
GET {{RateLimitApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
